5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We must ensure that whatever we select is financially sustainable beyond the initial investment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree, but we also need evidence that these programs actually improve patient outcomes.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,We can't forget the staff. We need to know if the teams can actually handle more work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,And the building! We need to make sure we have the rooms and parking to support it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is also important to see why previous attempts failed so we don't repeat those mistakes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, you're right. If the infrastructure fails, the budget is wasted.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, staffing is a variable, but data on past trials is a constant we can trust.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, data is fine, but exhausted nurses can't implement a program.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I just don't want the booking system to crash or the car park to overflow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Let us look into the records to see where the gaps truly lie.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the ledger and the regional tariffs to see the money flow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll look at the readmission figures and the booking system records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll examine the nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery review.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the rooms and parking, and the booking system as well.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the board minutes and the shared nursing round results.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
