35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The budget is down by a quarter, and off-site contacts bring in no regional funding.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Interestingly, a previous call-back trial significantly reduced readmissions for the elderly.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We have severe nursing vacancies, but the midwifery rota actually has some unusual slack.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The car park is full by eleven and the booking system only tracks fixed slots.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Joint clinics have failed here before, and off-site visits are often missed due to access.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, if off-site visits are unreliable and unfunded, we should avoid them.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, but the readmission data proves that those calls actually work for the patients.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, if the booking system is limited, we need a program that doesn't rely on complex scheduling.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,Exactly. Anything requiring heavy outpatient room use will just seize up the hospital.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the midwifery slack you mentioned could be a very stable foundation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,We need a program that generates revenue or costs very little to maintain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The readmission drop is a huge win, but I see the systemic risks you all mention.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,A program using the midwifery team would avoid adding pressure to the struggling ward nurses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"And if it's a small, focused group, it might not overwhelm the parking and shuttle.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We must avoid any arrangement where two departments have to fight over a single budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
