60,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Candidate A and D are off-site, meaning no tariffs. B needs rooms we don't have.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"A has the best evidence for patient impact, but D helps the most complex cases.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,C fits perfectly with the midwifery slack and doesn't burden the ward nurses.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,C is the safest for the infrastructure. B would be a nightmare for the car park.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"C is a joint effort, but if we use the existing midwifery slack, it's more stable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,C is the most fiscally responsible choice given the ledger's current state.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I'm torn, but if A and D are unfunded and unrecorded, they will just be buried.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, C still provides vital support to new parents, which is a clear benefit.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I can't support B or D. The booking system and parking just can't take it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree. C is the most sustainable and least likely to collapse in year two.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,Let's move toward C. It avoids the funding trap of off-site work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"If the others are against A and D for systemic reasons, I will concede to C.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,It's the most harmonious choice for the staff and the patients.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm fully on board with C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have found a path that respects both the people and the budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
